#!/usr/bin/env beg

Accept a payouts CSV with payout_id, invoice_id, date, amount columns and an
invoices CSV with invoice_id, date, amount columns. IDs are unique within their
own tables, dates are YYYY-MM-DD, and amounts are exact decimals.

Match explicit invoice IDs first. For payouts with a blank invoice ID, look among
the remaining invoices for an equal amount and a date within three days either
way. Confirm a match only when the payout has one candidate and that invoice
has only one candidate payout. Report competing claims as ambiguous.

Write a JSON object with matched pairs ({payout, invoice}), ambiguous claims
({payout, invoices}), and lists of unmatched_payouts and unmatched_invoices.
Use IDs in the report. Keep ambiguous IDs out of the unmatched lists.
